# Java CI/CD Pipeline with Jenkins, Docker & Kubernetes

## Practical Steps

1. Create Java Maven project
2. Create `pom.xml`
3. Develop Java application
4. Create `Dockerfile`
5. Create Kubernetes `deployment.yaml`
6. Push source code to GitHub
7. Configure Jenkins Pipeline
8. Configure JDK 17 and Maven
9. Checkout code from GitHub
10. Run Maven Build
11. Run Maven Test
12. Build Docker Image
13. Push Docker Image to Docker Hub
14. Connect Jenkins to Kubernetes on AWS EC2
15. Deploy application to Kubernetes
16. Verify Kubernetes Nodes, Pods and Service
17. Expose application using NodePort
18. Test application through browser
19. Verify complete CI/CD pipeline
